{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53914","headline":"浮云宫 · 宣宗皇帝李忱","name":"浮云宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道人西蜀来，自谓八万岁。\n爱此华林幽，穴居聊避世。\n真风度万劫，神仙邈相继。\n灵岫摩天空，鸟道入云际。\n石罅紫苔封，泉泓墨龙憇。\n碧桃花未开，白鹿迹已逝。\n春风撼山馆，急雪舞林底。\n涤除衣上尘，刮尽眼中瞖。\n何当赠刀圭，岂复便俗吏。\n吾不学李宽，盗名职嘲戏。\n（见影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《江西通志》卷一四七、同治十二年刊萧浚兰纂《瑞州府志》卷二一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝李忱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}